{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24770","headline":"和梦得夏至忆苏州呈卢宾客 · 白居易","name":"和梦得夏至忆苏州呈卢宾客","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忆在苏州日，常谙夏至筵。\n糉香筒竹嫩，炙脆子鹅鲜。\n水国多台榭，吴风尚管弦。\n每家皆有酒，无处不过船。\n交印君相次，褰帷我在前。\n此乡俱老矣，东望共依然。\n洛下麦秋月，江南梅雨天。\n齐云楼上事，已上十三年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24770.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24770","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}